  <section id="guide" class="section split" aria-labelledby="guide-title"><div><p class="release">Quick start</p><h2 id="guide-title">Get into your<br />first song.</h2><p>Ten original songs with music included. Play with a controller or keyboard.</p><p><a class="download" href={site.downloadUrl}>Download for Windows <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></p><a class="text-link" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}guide.txt`}>Download the plain-text guide</a></div><ol><li><h3>Download and extract</h3><p>Extract the ZIP, then open <strong>Play.exe</strong> to begin.</p></li><li><h3>Choose a song</h3><p>Start with any of the 10 included tracks in Songs. Pick a difficulty and press Play.</p></li><li><h3>Find your rhythm</h3><p>Try Easy first, or use Practice to slow a song down and play without failing. Autoplay lets you watch a song before trying it.</p></li></ol></section>
  <section class="section split" aria-labelledby="controls-title"><div><h2 id="controls-title">Controller or keyboard.<br />Your choice.</h2><p>Use the face buttons or D-pad on a controller, or the arrow keys on a keyboard. Hold the matching button until a long note ends.</p><p class="small">Xbox button labels are shown below. Follow the button hints when moving through menus.</p></div><div><table class="control-table"><caption>Default controls</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Controller</th><th scope="col">Keyboard</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Yellow rocket</th><td><kbd class="pad yellow">Y</kbd></td><td><kbd>↑</kbd> / <kbd>W</kbd></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Red rocket</th><td><kbd class="pad red">B</kbd></td><td><kbd>→</kbd> / <kbd>D</kbd></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Green rocket</th><td><kbd class="pad green">A</kbd></td><td><kbd>↓</kbd> / <kbd>S</kbd></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Blue rocket</th><td><kbd class="pad blue">X</kbd></td><td><kbd>←</kbd> / <kbd>A</kbd></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Golden Tower</th><td>RT / RB</td><td>Space / left Shift</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Black Hole</th><td>LT / LB</td><td>Left Ctrl / B</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pause</th><td>Start</td><td>Esc</td></tr></tbody></table><p class="small">Regular hits build Golden Tower. Holds charge Black Hole. Save both to multiply their bonuses together.</p></div></section>
  <section id="audio" class="section split" aria-labelledby="audio-title"><div><h2 id="audio-title">Ten songs ready to play.<br />Add more of your favorites.</h2><p>The 10 original tracks include their music. For Tower OST, Boom Boom Rocket originals, and custom songs, add your own recording. Bring a copy you have permission to play.</p></div><div class="answers"><details open><summary>How do I add music?</summary><p>Choose a song, then select Add audio to pick a music file or paste a YouTube link. Use the same version of the song so the notes line up. Edit audio lets you change or remove it later.</p></details><details><summary>Why isn't every song's music included?</summary><p>Recordings for other songs belong to their owners and aren't included in the download. The audio panel shows search terms to help you find the right recording.</p></details><details><summary>Can I use YouTube?</summary><p>Yes. Paste the video link into the song's audio panel. You'll need an internet connection. Check that the music lines up before you play.</p></details><details><summary>Can I import more songs?</summary><p>Choose Import to add songs from BeatSaver, a supported GitHub link, or a song pack.</p></details><details><summary>Are my scores saved?</summary><p>Yes. Scores and progress are saved on your PC. Keep the user folder when updating the game. Online leaderboards aren't available in this playtest.</p></details><details><summary>What do I need to play?</summary><p>A 64-bit Windows 10 or 11 PC and a controller or keyboard. If you need help opening the game, see the <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}guide.txt`}>setup guide</a>.</p></details></div></section>
